      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT to understand the code before improving it.Now I understand the test. It decodes an 8-byte ASCII binary string where only the first byte is `'1'` (ASCII 49), which represents the most significant bit, producing `0x80` (-128). Let me write a more understandable version.Now I'll compile-check the generated test.The improved test compiled successfully (`COMPILE_OK`)."
